   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Retries and dead letters, note 3 of 5: stop making the partition wait. Park the failed record on a retry topic, label it with\nwhen to come back, and keep the main line flowing.\nRead top to bottom, following the black arrows.",
   "originalText": "Retries and dead letters, note 3 of 5: stop making the partition wait. Park the failed record on a retry topic, label it with\nwhen to come back, and keep the main line flowing.\nRead top to bottom, following the black arrows.",
