   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Note 2 ended with a problem: a consumer cannot sleep for minutes without being thrown out of its group. The fix is to move the waiting OUT of the\nmain partition and INTO Kafka itself.",
   "originalText": "Note 2 ended with a problem: a consumer cannot sleep for minutes without being thrown out of its group. The fix is to move the waiting OUT of the\nmain partition and INTO Kafka itself.",
