   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\"the batch handler waits for the ack before committing the source offset; if the publish fails, the source offset is not committed and the chunk is retried (so a\nDLQ record can be duplicated; noted for Stage 3)\"",
   "originalText": "\"the batch handler waits for the ack before committing the source offset; if the publish fails, the source offset is not committed and the chunk is retried (so a\nDLQ record can be duplicated; noted for Stage 3)\"",
