   "text": "A sleep blocks the loop and starves heartbeats and polling, so the consumer is\nevicted. A timer that holds the MESSAGE loses it on restart. (A timer that only\ncalls resume() is fine.)",
   "originalText": "A sleep blocks the loop and starves heartbeats and polling, so the consumer is\nevicted. A timer that holds the MESSAGE loses it on restart. (A timer that only\ncalls resume() is fine.)",
